---@field Comment? aws.ssm.Comment User-specified information about the command, such as a brief description of what the command should do.
---@field ExpiresAfter? aws.ssm.DateTime If a command expires, it changes status to DeliveryTimedOut for all invocations that have the status InProgress, Pending, or Delayed. ExpiresAfter is calculated based on the total timeout for the overall command. For more information, see Understanding command timeout values in the Amazon Web Services Systems Manager User Guide.
---@field Parameters? distilled.Secret The parameter values to be inserted in the document when running the command.
