---@field NotificationConfig? aws.ssm.NotificationConfig Configurations for sending notifications about command status changes.
---@field CloudWatchOutputConfig? aws.ssm.CloudWatchOutputConfig Amazon CloudWatch Logs information where you want Amazon Web Services Systems Manager to send the command output.
