---@field EndDate? aws.ssm.MaintenanceWindowStringDateTime The date and time, in ISO-8601 Extended format, for when the maintenance window is scheduled to become inactive. The maintenance window won't run after this specified time.
---@field Schedule? aws.ssm.MaintenanceWindowSchedule The schedule of the maintenance window in the form of a cron or rate expression.
